["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"155. 和科沃斯錢程聊，父與子、企二代接班的樣本與肌理、機器人，和我內心的追尋 physical AI FSD repetition\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-21-zhangxiaojun-29岁当上科沃斯ceo-他说那是愚昧之巅不是人生巅峰/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/655ca401e97f9e11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>29歲當上科沃斯CEO,他說那是愚昧之巔不是人生巔峰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他接任CEO時以為到達人生巔峰，後來才明白那是一次史詩級錯判：戰略方向全對，卻因為不懂公司怎麼做決策，兩三年都沒把自己和組織的神經接上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企二代接班</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"#887: Q&amp;A with Tim — The 4-Hour Workweek in a World of AI, Rebuilding Personal Agency, The 4-Hour Body After 40, and More DEAL framework Oryx red teaming accelerated TMS vagal nerve stimulation Gymnastic Strength Training (GST)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-timferriss-ai不会省时间-只会把垃圾工作做得更快/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>AI不會省時間，只會把垃圾工作做得更快</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沒有先定義和砍掉該做的事，AI只是加速器：它不會創造閒暇，只會把瑣碎、無關緊要的任務放大成更多工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人效率</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Programmable Data Center — Evan Conrad, SF Compute physical settlement cash settlement basis risk order book backplane InfiniBand fabric\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-latentspace-英伟达造不出算力期货市场-因为做了就得放弃自己的推理生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/74ca452fc18a3198-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">36:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達造不出算力期貨市場：因為做了就得放棄自己的推理生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有手握算力供給的玩家都有自己的生意要保護，只有徹底放棄推理和雲業務、只做中立撮合的人，才能讓這個價格被所有人信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力交易</span><span class=\"tag\">物理結算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Marriott on the End of Reading Reading Revolution Republic of Letters ethnolinguistic fractionalization post-literate\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-goodfight-识字真正训练的不是知识-而是把情绪逐出说理的能力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>識字真正訓練的不是知識，而是把情緒逐出說理的能力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬里奧特認為，識字真正的作用是把魅力、情緒等非理性說服手段逐出公共說理；讀寫衰退，意味著靠人格和情緒煽動的政治正捲土重來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">閱讀衰退</span><span class=\"tag\">識字與民主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Anthropic Gives Away 5% of Its Shares, Clone’s Muscle Robot, ElevenLabs Steals Podcaster&#x27;s Voice Public Benefit Corporation (PBC) McKibben muscle antagonistic actuation preference stack\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-twist-人形机器人新方案-水压人工肌肉造价只要电机拉线的十分之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ebb4c2b15536a9a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>人形機器人新方案：水壓人工肌肉造價只要電機拉線的十分之一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Clone Robotics 不用電機拉線去模擬肌肉，而是給編織套管裡的彈性管加壓液體讓它直接收縮，CEO稱這套方案造價只要電機驅動人形機器人的十分之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人工肌肉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A World Model of Life: Biohub&#x27;s Alex Rives on Virtual Cells, Measurement, &amp; the $1.8B Data Push ESM AlphaFold RLVR laser phase plate cryo-electron tomography organoids\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-cogrev-18亿美元押注的不是数据量-而是重新定义怎么-看见-细胞/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c97e57b81c6b9f77-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>18億美元押注的不是數據量，而是重新定義怎麼「看見」細胞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alex Rives認為虛擬細胞模型多年做不出來，真正瓶頸不是算力或數據量不夠，而是我們對細胞內部能觀測到的東西太有限——測量能力才是模型的天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">虛擬細胞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When Everyone Has a Health Expert in Their Pocket? | OpenAI’s Karan Singhal Move 37 HealthBench Professional A1C EHR\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-a16z-openai做医疗ai不走专科模型路线-赌的是通用模型会持续变强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI做醫療AI不走專科模型路線，賭的是通用模型會持續變強</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">專科醫療模型很快會被通用前沿模型甩開，OpenAI選擇把數百名醫生提供的專科數據訓練進每一代GPT裡，而不是單獨做一個醫療專用模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療AI</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"509 通往戰時陪都之路：盧作孚建設重慶北碚往事\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-cn2aa250-一个剿匪的民团-如何变成重庆工业化的发动机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>一個剿匪的民團，如何變成重慶工業化的發動機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">重慶後來的軍工基因不是抗戰才種下的：盧作孚把一個原本只管剿匪的團練局，改造成了修鐵路、開科學院的地方政府雛形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民國史</span><span class=\"tag\">地方自治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Beyond chores: How to teach kids to notice what needs to be done and share the mental load with Sam Kelly mental load noticing walk notice and do preexisting motivators dandelion effect\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-secureattach-真正该教孩子的不是做家务-而是-注意到-需要做什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>真正該教孩子的不是做家務，而是「注意到」需要做什麼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者花一年教會丈夫主動發現家務，卻驚覺自己仍在替孩子做「注意」這部分工作——這個代際循環，她決定從孩子這一代開始打破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理負荷</span><span class=\"tag\">育兒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Christina Cacioppo - Building an Enduring Software Company in the Age of AI - [Invest Like the Best, EP.496] FDE harness outcome pricing trust graph\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-ilt-vanta情愿倒贴ai成本-也不敢把token费用转嫁给客户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4850cdb6fa3385e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">57:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>Vanta情願倒貼AI成本，也不敢把token費用轉嫁給客戶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用戶精明到一眼能算出你在加價轉賣Claude的token,所以Vanta寧可自己吃成本、把更多客戶推進agent式使用，定價的事留到以後再解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SaaS定價</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CME&#x27;s Terry Duffy on the Disconcerting State of Finance Regulation self-certification perpetual futures funding rate core principle KYC 1256 tax treatment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-oddlots-芝商所ceo-两千五百份监管申报全部通过-一个没被拒绝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">29:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>芝商所CEO：兩千五百份監管申報全部通過，一個沒被拒絕</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國商品期貨交易委員會近兩千五百份新產品申報無一被拒，連「大胃王吃幾個熱狗」都能過審——芝商所CEO Terry Duffy說這等於監管名存實亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融監管</span><span class=\"tag\">永續期貨</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Ep 225 Peptides: What your peptide dealer doesn’t want you to know GLP-1 compounding pharmacy 503A bulks list halo effect acromegaly\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-tpwky-fda换掉审查委员后-被警示有风险的肽类产品照样获批/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>FDA換掉審查委員後，被警示有風險的肽類產品照樣獲批</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科學審查小組對七種流行肽類全票給出安全警示，但RFK換掉八名委員後的新班子幾乎全票放行，監管結論和政治任命之間的裂縫被擺上了檯面。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肽類</span><span class=\"tag\">灰色市場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to Handle Halloween Group Costume Drama | Dr. Tori Cordiano overdetermination group think helping without fixing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-asklisa-万圣节装扮吵的不是服装-是谁说了算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a66bc85f3dcba29e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">38:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>萬聖節裝扮吵的不是服裝，是誰說了算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">七年級女孩的團體萬聖節裝扮之爭，表面在爭服裝款式，實則是誰被排除、誰手握社交權力的較量——裝扮只是把這場談判擺上檯面的容器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">同伴關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Can the polygraph test really spot a lie? Frye ruling Employee Polygraph Protection Act security theater cardiopneumopsychograph\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-throughline-测谎仪不测谎-测的是让人认罪的心理恐惧/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b48f118d14260753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>測謊儀不測謊，測的是讓人認罪的心理恐懼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國法院從不信測謊儀的科學性，卻允許警察靠它逼出口供——它的價值從來不是測謊，而是靠心理恐懼製造認罪和持續監視。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">測謊儀</span><span class=\"tag\">職場監控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The MATCH Act and China’s DUV Imports DUV EUV SME FDPR countrywide control / entity control NXT:1980\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-20-chinatalk-一款仍在放行的光刻机-可能在十年内让中国芯片产能追平美国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/96067a661c27c771-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>一款仍在放行的光刻機，可能在十年內讓中國芯片產能追平美國</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國智庫測算：只要繼續放行這款浸沒式光刻機，十年後中國芯片產能可能逼近甚至追平美國；一旦徹底斷供，這個可能性就被永久關閉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">光刻機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E256｜Agent、機器人與製藥，誰先被GPT-6 Astra改寫？ Computer Use TAMP Real-to-Sim MCP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-19-sv101-astra让机器人一步跨进gpt时刻-却在ai制药撞上验证墙/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>Astra讓機器人一步跨進GPT時刻，卻在AI製藥撞上驗證牆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">機器人因為能自我反思迭代而實現質變，但AI製藥設計分子只需幾小時，真實驗證卻要老鼠和猴子的新陳代謝週期，這道牆沒有任何模型能跨過。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dylan Field: Is AI Replacing Designers?, Design is the New Code &amp; Democratizing Creativity SaaS apocalypse (Saspocalypse) Overton window MCP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-19-allin-不是-ai-抬高了创造力天花板-是人自己在抬/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/82dd95dca9a9be1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>不是 AI 抬高了創造力天花板，是人自己在抬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Figma 創始人說，幾年前他曾預言 AI 會抬高創意的天花板，現在他承認說錯了——AI 只是把做東西的門檻降低了，真正把天花板往上推的，只有願意大膽冒險的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Figma</span><span class=\"tag\">反壟斷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Audio long read: How to stay smart in the age of AI — the science of critical thinking metacognition lateral reading inoculation (against misinformation) illusion of understanding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-19-naturepod-ai没把批判性思维教育搞砸-它本来就没被教好过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">16:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>AI沒把批判性思維教育搞砸——它本來就沒被教好過</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">批判性思維教育本就沒做好，AI只是讓問題提前攤牌；唯一被證據支持的解法不是禁用AI,而是讓學習保持「摩擦感」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">批判性思維</span><span class=\"tag\">AI教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 402: Plato Talks Homer: Hippias Minor and Ion (Part Two) techne rhapsode eudaimonia mimesis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-19-pel-苏格拉底证明-存心作恶的人比无心作恶的人更优越/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b252022407fe296f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>蘇格拉底證明：存心作惡的人比無心作惡的人更優越</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這與法律直覺完全相反——蓄意殺人比過失殺人判得更重，但蘇格拉底靠跑步、瘸腿的腳和迷路的舵手，一步步把聽眾繞進這個結論。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">柏拉圖對話錄</span><span class=\"tag\">蘇格拉底</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When Al Agents Can Spend Your Money? FDE (Forward Deployed Engineer) Jevons Paradox PLG (Product-Led Growth) breakage model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-19-a16z-town-不绑定任何大模型-企业真正该囤的是数据和记忆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>Town 不綁定任何大模型：企業真正該囤的是數據和記憶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沒人知道哪家大模型三五年後仍最強，Town 索性保持中立，把數據和記憶權留給企業，換取客戶永遠能隨時遷移。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Don Wilson on the GPU Market&#x27;s Trillion Dollar Question crack spread / crush spread / crunch spread perps neocloud IOSCO basis trade\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-19-oddlots-没人知道gpu四年后值多少钱-期货市场就是为此而生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">26:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>沒人知道GPU四年後值多少錢，期貨市場就是為此而生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">H100時租價格去年觸底後隨Anthropic新模型發布而反彈，證明GPU的價值會隨AI需求劇烈波動而非單調貶值，這正是期貨合約需要存在的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力期貨</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Seinfeld Fin-Syn rules syndication counterpositioning callback\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-19-acquired-宋飞正传-停播近30年-版权收入已经滚到70亿美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/385ee3d9536f1297-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>《宋飛正傳》停播近30年，版權收入已經滾到70億美元+</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1970年代一條禁止電視網持有節目財務權益的規定，讓製片方拿走幾乎全部長期收益——2.5億美元成本的喜劇，如今變成每十年還能再賺10億美元的版權資產。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">版權經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">好萊塢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Khmer Rouge &amp; Pol Pot&#x27;s Reign of Terror Year Zero Killing Fields base people / new people Democratic Kampuchea\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-19-historyhit-美军轰炸把红色高棉从几千人炸成二十万大军/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb5c194e3b976eba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>美軍轟炸把紅色高棉從幾千人炸成二十萬大軍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">紅色高棉人數從1969年的三千人漲到1973年底的二十萬，漲幅幾乎全部來自美軍地毯式轟炸激起的平民仇恨，而非意識形態感召。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">柬埔寨</span><span class=\"tag\">紅色高棉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Is ADHD a Disability, or Just a Difference We Treat Like One? species typical functioning executive function misrecognition peer-mediated programs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-19-parentmojo-adhd通向早逝的-不是大脑缺陷-而是层层叠加的排斥与羞辱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD通向早逝的，不是大腦缺陷，而是層層疊加的排斥與羞辱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkley用鐘形曲線把ADHD框成天賦的對立面，但節目追蹤證據鏈發現，推向早逝、自殺、輟學的，是同伴長期排斥和教師敵意，而非大腦本身的缺陷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">兒童發展</span>\n</div></div></a>"]